        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer a wide range of banking products and services, including: 1) retail banking;",
        "start_character": 706,
        "end_character": 791
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000868671-26-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000868671-26-000023-60260a22677a6f92",
        "accession_number": "0000868671-26-000023",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide a full range of banking services to individuals and businesses from 281 locations in Montana, Idaho, Utah, Washington, Wyoming, Colorado, Arizona, Nevada, and Texas through our wholly-owned bank subsidiary, Glacier Bank (the “Bank”).",
        "start_character": 461,
        "end_character": 705
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000868671-26-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000868671-26-000023-60260a22677a6f92",
        "accession_number": "0000868671-26-000023",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We strive to engage in the banking business in a responsible manner, and we recognize that our activities impact the communities where we operate.",
        "start_character": 46085,
        "end_character": 46231
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000868671-26-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000868671-26-000023-60260a22677a6f92",
        "accession_number": "0000868671-26-000023",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For select management-level employees, we also offer our long-term incentive plan, which is an equity-based compensation plan that is designed to encourage achievement of long-term financial goals as determined by the Company’s Board of Directors (the “Board”) from time to time, and to further retention through long-term vesting of certain awards earned.",
        "start_character": 11283,
        "end_character": 11639
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000868671-26-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000868671-26-000023-60260a22677a6f92",
        "accession_number": "0000868671-26-000023",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "However, some regulators in the states in which we operate were increasingly active in proposing, enacting, and enforcing consumer protection regulations.",
        "start_character": 20770,
        "end_character": 20924
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000868671-26-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000868671-26-000023-60260a22677a6f92",
        "accession_number": "0000868671-26-000023",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The following table summarizes our number of locations, the number of counties we serve and the percentage of Federal Deposit Insurance Corporation (“FDIC”) insured deposits we have in those counties for each of the nine states we operate in.",
        "start_character": 7090,
        "end_character": 7332
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000868671-26-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000868671-26-000023-60260a22677a6f92",
        "accession_number": "0000868671-26-000023",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We also encourage employee growth and development in a variety of ways, including through formal and informal training, continuing education, relationships with colleagues and internal mentors, and by making a variety of resources available.",
        "start_character": 8610,
        "end_character": 8851
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000868671-26-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000868671-26-000023-60260a22677a6f92",
        "accession_number": "0000868671-26-000023",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are continually monitoring developments in the states in which our customers are located in an effort to maintain compliance with applicable cybersecurity-related requirements.",
        "start_character": 44399,
        "end_character": 44578
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000868671-26-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000868671-26-000023-60260a22677a6f92",
        "accession_number": "0000868671-26-000023",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe that it is consistent with our community banking model to be good stewards of our franchise, active in the communities we serve, and with a particular focus on the development and well-being of our employees.",
        "start_character": 46232,
        "end_character": 46451
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000868671-26-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000868671-26-000023-60260a22677a6f92",
        "accession_number": "0000868671-26-000023",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have developed several programs to encourage a safe and healthy workplace, including:",
        "start_character": 9879,
        "end_character": 9967
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000868671-26-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000868671-26-000023-60260a22677a6f92",
        "accession_number": "0000868671-26-000023",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have established comprehensive compliance programs designed to comply with the requirements of the BSA and the PATRIOT Act.",
        "start_character": 37531,
        "end_character": 37657
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000868671-26-000023",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000868671-26-000023-60260a22677a6f92",
        "accession_number": "0000868671-26-000023",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "Because we are an institution with more than $10 billion in assets, we are also subject to regulation and supervision by the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau (“CFPB”), the scope of which has varied widely depending on the priorities of the executive branch of the federal government.",
        "start_character": 15161,
        "end_character": 15448
      }
